<size=10></size>\n·处于<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·聚爆</color>，队伍中的角色附加<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>时，附加1层<color=Highlight><te href=121013>聚爆轨迹</te></color>，上限为30层，持续30秒。\n处于战斗状态时，队伍中登场角色周围的敌人<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>层数为0，将对目标附加1层<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>。敌人<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>层数大于5层时，根据<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>层数上限引爆<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>，并移除<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>层数。\n<size=10></size>\n处于<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·震谐</color>/<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·聚爆</color>时，以下技能造成伤害时，可为目标附加<color=Highlight><te href=100002>【震谐·偏移】</te></color>/<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>，同一技能对同一目标3秒内只能触发1次。\n<color=Highlight>普攻·爱弥斯第3段</color>、<color=Highlight>普攻·爱弥斯第4段</color>、<color=Highlight>普攻·机兵第3段</color>、<color=Highlight>普攻·机兵第4段</color>、共鸣技能<color=Highlight>合击·突刺·兵装融合</color>、共鸣技能<color=Highlight>合击·突刺·启明之音</color>、变奏技能<color=Highlight>以旋律穿越长空</color>、变奏技能<color=Highlight>携星辉降临于此</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>根据<color=Highlight>共鸣模态</color>获得强化效果：\n·处于<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·震谐</color>时，施放共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>期间，移除附近目标的<color=Highlight><te href=121012>震谐轨迹</te></color>并额外造成5次<color=Highlight>震谐伤害</color>，每次随机选择范围内的1个目标。目标每被移除1层<color=Highlight><te href=121012>震谐轨迹</te></color>，使其受到共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>额外造成的震谐伤害倍率提升4%，该效果持续1秒。额外造成的震谐伤害不受目标的<color=Highlight>【偏谐值】</color>影响。\n·处于<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·聚爆</color>时，共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>期间，若目标拥有<color=Highlight><te href=121013>聚爆轨迹</te></color>，则移除目标的<color=Highlight><te href=121013>聚爆轨迹</te></color>，并根据<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>层数上限引爆<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>，本次引爆不移除<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>层数。根据目标被移除的<color=Highlight><te href=121013>聚爆轨迹</te></color>层数，提升本次<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>对<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>主目标的伤害倍率，每层提升10%。\n<size=10></size>\n<color=Highlight>星屑共振</color>状态，根据<color=Highlight>共鸣模态</color>提升共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>效果：\n·处于<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·震谐</color>时，共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>额外造成的<color=Highlight>震谐伤害</color>次数提升至10次。\n·处于<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·聚爆</color>时，共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>引爆的<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>，对<color=Highlight>【<te href=850011>聚爆效应</te>】</color>主目标的伤害倍率额外提升200%，该倍率提升效果与<color=Highlight><te href=121013>聚爆轨迹</te></color>的倍率提升效果相互叠加。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>震谐响应·星爆</color></size>\n处于<color=Highlight>共鸣模态·震谐</color>时可生效，爱弥斯对范围内处于<color=Highlight><te href=100004>【震谐·干涉】</te></color>状态的目标造成<color=Fire>热熔伤害</color>，此次伤害为震谐伤害。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>流光突进</color></size>\n处于机兵形态，且<color=Highlight>【<te href=121009>流溢辉光</te>】</color>大于200点，可通过探索工具施放<color=Highlight>流光突进</color>进行飞行移动，<color=Highlight>流光突进</color>期间持续消耗<color=Highlight>【<te href=121009>流溢辉光</te>】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>【同步率】获取规则</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【同步率】</color>上限200点。\n·<color=Highlight>普攻·爱弥斯</color>、<color=Highlight>空中攻击·爱弥斯</color>、<color=Highlight>闪避反击·爱弥斯</color>、<color=Highlight>普攻·机兵</color>、<color=Highlight>空中攻击·机兵</color>、<color=Highlight>闪避反击·机兵</color>、共鸣技能<color=Highlight>合击·突刺·启明之音</color>、共鸣技能<color=Highlight>合击·突刺·兵装融合</color>造成伤害时，获得<color=Highlight>【同步率】</color>。\n·施放变奏技能<color=Highlight>以旋律穿越长空</color>、变奏技能<color=Highlight>携星辉降临于此</color>时，获得40点<color=Highlight>【同步率】</color>。\n·施放共鸣解放<color=Highlight>星辉破界而来·过载</color>时，获得30点<color=Highlight>【同步率】</color>。\n·同时处于<color=Highlight><te href=121001>即刻响应</te></color>状态与<color=Highlight><te href=121003>星辉破界而来·于此释放</te></color>状态，施放<color=Highlight>重击·爱弥斯·二段蓄力</color>或<color=Highlight>重击·机兵·二段蓄力</color>时，可获得200点<color=Highlight>【同步率】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>【共鸣率】获取规则</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【共鸣率】</color>上限4点。\n施放共鸣技能<color=Highlight><te href=121007>光翼共奏</te></color>时，获得1点<color=Highlight>【共鸣率】</color>。\n施放共鸣解放<color=Highlight>星辉破界而来·过载</color>时，获得1点<color=Highlight>【共鸣率】</color>。\n处于<color=Highlight>流光增幅</color>状态，施放共鸣解放<color=Highlight>星辉破界而来·过载</color>时，可额外获得1点<color=Highlight>【共鸣率】</color>。\n<size=10></size>\n<size=40><color=Title>【流溢辉光】获取规则</color></size>\n<color=Highlight>【流溢辉光】</color>上限600点。\n随时间持续获得<color=Highlight>【流溢辉光】</color>。","values":[["光翼共奏·登台伤害","17.90%*4+35.79%*3+178.93%","热熔","5","160"],["光翼共奏·降临伤害","17.90%+14.92%*6+23.86%*3+59.65%*3","热熔","5.05","160.04"],["震谐响应·星爆伤害","596.43%偏谐系数","热熔",null,null],["光翼共奏追加伤害（每次）","109.35%偏谐系数","热熔",null,null]],"damage":{"121099004":{"element":2,"related_property":"攻击","type":12,"rate_lv":[30000,32460,34920,38364,40824,43653,47589,51525,55461,59643,64563,69483,74403,79323,84243,89163,94083,99003,103923,108843],"energy":0,"element_power":0,"hardness_lv":10000,"tough_lv":0,"weakness_lvl":0},"1210110507":{"element":2,"related_property":"攻击","type":12,"rate_lv":[5500,5951,6402,7034,7485,8004,8725,9447,10168,10935,11837,12739,13641,14543,15445,16347,17249,18151,19053,19955],"energy":0,"element_power":0,"hardness_lv":10000,"tough_lv":1620,"weakness_lvl":0},"1210110508":{"element":2,"related_property":"攻击","type":12,"rate_lv":[5500,5951,6402,7034,7485,8004,8725,9447,10168,10935,11837,12739,13641,14543,15445,16347,17249,18151,19053,19955],"energy":0,"element_power":0,"hardness_lv":10000,"tough_lv":1620,"weakness_lvl":0},"1210210506":{"element":2,"related_property":"攻击","type":12,"rate_lv":[5500,5951,6402,7034,7485,8004,8725,9447,10168,10935,11837,12739,13641,14543,15445,16347,17249,18151,19053,19955],"energy":0,"element_power":0,"hardness_lv":10000,"tough_lv":1620,"weakness_lvl":0},"1210210507":{"element":2,"related_property":"攻击","type":12,"rate_lv":[5500,5951,6402,7034,